# ttr: dialect=b lang=en
Load orders as o.
Load stock as sk.
Join o optionally with sk on item is sk.item and sk.qty is not empty as all_orders.
Keep only the rows that have a match in sk on item is sk.item.
Keep only the rows that have no match in returns on item is returns.item.
Remove the rows that have a match in blocked on item is blocked.item.
Show the result as checked.
Join o with sk on relation order_stock as linked.
Show the result as linked_view.
Join o optionally with sk on relation order_stock as maybe_linked.
